{"id":1791640977803,"ts":1791640977803,"dur":182,"text":"So, we're going to start with the initial question, okay? I'm going to start with the initial question, let's say, that takes about 25 seconds, okay? Then, say it, then you do something, okay? What do you want to do then? Then, you show the app, well, this is our app, Alive. It works like this. You click record, and it automatically stores, hey, Alive, I was walking down the street and I saw blah, blah, blah. No, no, what it says is, I have this great business idea for creating an app that stores my thoughts. I think I'm going to call it Alive. Oh, that's a good idea, huh? Okay? You say that, okay? You save it and upload it, and it automatically saves it and puts it in the timeline. Not only that. Saves it, transcribes it, makes key bullet points, and finds, yeah, like, gets and extracts the key bullet points of the app. Okay? Then, after that, we say, okay, guys, we'd love for you to try it out. We put the QR code. Okay? There? Yes. No, no, no, because, well, okay, let's explain a little bit more. Then, I'll explain. Okay, so, what does it do? It has the memory bank, and it has the timeline. For now, that's, well, you can also put pictures, whatever, put pictures and key bullet points. But just because they're bullet points, it's not illegal. You know what? It can also, you can also add pictures to make the memory more memorable. Okay? But, on some things we would like to add in the future, but we weren't able to add yet. Okay? We'd like to add different categories for different things in life. For example, work-related stuff, or business ideas, or people things, or et cetera. And then, we want to train it so that it recognizes patterns inside those categories in life and helps you advance. For example, if you have a business idea and you already talked to it prior, that it helped you to go on a walk before a meeting, then it's going to remind you. Go on a walk before a meeting. It's going to help you calm the stress. Good. And then, lastly, I would like to say, Alive works the following way. Alive stores all the data that you give it and then transcribes it. It only works with you. Whenever you talk to it, you grow it together. So, use Alive. I don't quite like the idea of having the app tell you what to do. So, if you say, I'm nervous, I don't think you should rely on the app telling you what to do. I think the app is more useful. So, I'm thinking we should unload your thoughts.","proc":{"t0":1791640977803,"t":1791640990850,"stage":"bullets"},"audio":true,"audioExt":"webm","wave":[79,100,100,100,100,91,73,74,61,63,97,100,85,78,76,100,100,96,100,65,100,93,100,69,76,100,100,100,100,85,100,74,100,77,100,52,95,100,98,100,100,100,90,84,76,92,65,100],"u":1791640990850,"words":[{"w":"So","s":3.4,"e":3.88},{"w":"we're","s":5.58,"e":5.76},{"w":"going","s":5.76,"e":5.78},{"w":"to","s":5.78,"e":5.98},{"w":"start","s":5.98,"e":6.1},{"w":"with","s":6.1,"e":6.66},{"w":"the","s":6.66,"e":7.1},{"w":"initial","s":7.1,"e":7.44},{"w":"question","s":7.44,"e":7.8},{"w":"okay","s":7.86,"e":8.04},{"w":"I'm","s":8.18,"e":8.38},{"w":"going","s":8.38,"e":8.44},{"w":"to","s":8.44,"e":8.54},{"w":"start","s":8.54,"e":8.62},{"w":"with","s":8.62,"e":8.78},{"w":"the","s":8.78,"e":8.88},{"w":"initial","s":8.88,"e":9.1},{"w":"question","s":9.1,"e":9.34},{"w":"let's","s":9.4,"e":9.66},{"w":"say","s":9.66,"e":9.68},{"w":"that","s":9.94,"e":10.22},{"w":"takes","s":10.22,"e":10.48},{"w":"about","s":10.48,"e":10.76},{"w":"25","s":10.76,"e":11.16},{"w":"seconds","s":11.16,"e":11.5},{"w":"okay","s":11.5,"e":11.88},{"w":"Then","s":12.8,"e":13.22},{"w":"say","s":13.38,"e":13.6},{"w":"it","s":13.6,"e":13.74},{"w":"then","s":14.16,"e":14.42},{"w":"you","s":14.42,"e":15.82},{"w":"do","s":15.82,"e":16.08},{"w":"something","s":16.08,"e":16.38},{"w":"okay","s":16.48,"e":16.9},{"w":"What","s":16.9,"e":17.04},{"w":"do","s":17.04,"e":17.12},{"w":"you","s":17.12,"e":17.14},{"w":"want","s":17.14,"e":17.28},{"w":"to","s":